  {
   "id": "unplaced",
   "kind": "not-yet-placed",
   "head": "Claims of the name, not placed on any of these lines",
   "note": "Nobody in this archive is unplaced: every person is on exactly one line. What is not placed is a cluster the archive tested and could not settle, drawn here as one dot, and the register's raw catch. 7 Booyzen claims for compensation were filed from the district of Marico in 1903-04, indexed by initials; nothing yet joins any of them to a person on these lines. And 6,828 of the register's 7,646 rows have no person page: they come from surname indexes, a shared surname is not a relationship, and they are counted in the register, not listed here.",
   "items": [
    [
